; corpus_data.ml, fuzz_corpus_data.ml and go_vectors_data.ml embed the pbt-v1
; corpus, the fuzz-v1 corpus and the Go fuzz engine's reference-vector table as
; OCaml strings, so the test binaries read no files and the package keeps a
; small capability manifest. The BUILD file checks each one byte for byte
; against its source.

